MY OWN MISTAKE, CORRECTED
  I first tried to fix the empty output with greedy decoding by constructing a blank
  openvino_genai.GenerationConfig(). That discards the model's own generation parameters (eos,
  repetition penalty, ...) and made EVERY request empty. Lesson: do not build a GenerationConfig from
  scratch; keep the model's default sampling (the model card recommends temperature 1.0 / top_p 0.95 /
  top_k 20 for general tasks).

